The '''Gunpowder Mines''' is the first floor of the {{Zone|Deep Caverns}}.

{{ZoneText |Talk to the Lift Operator.|Explore the caverns.|Mine Coal, Iron, and Gold Ore.|Watch out for Sneaky Creepers!}}

== Features ==
The '''Gunpowder Mines''' features a few attractions.

=== Lift Operator ===
{{Main|Lift Operator}}
In front of the lift shaft is the {{NPCSprite|Lift Operator}}, who allows players to teleport between layers of the [[Deep Caverns]] with ease. Once the player has entered the '''Gunpowder Mines''' and talked to the [[Lift Operator]], they will be able to teleport to the floor from any other level of the island.

=== Weak Wall ===
{{Main|Weak Wall}}
Located behind [[Walter]] is a weak wall made of cracked and non-cracked stone bricks. The wall can be exploded using either {{Item|Superboom TNT}} or {{Item|InfiniBoom™ TNT}}, revealing a small room containing a [[Fairy Soul]] in the corner.

